WEBVTT

00:08:28.038 --> 00:08:32.642
Ask yourself, does that woman bug me
for reasons that really matter?

00:08:32.675 --> 00:08:34.878
And forget about likability,

00:08:34.911 --> 00:08:36.780
ladies, women, if you can.

00:08:37.814 --> 00:08:40.483
Instead focus on being awesome.

00:08:40.483 --> 00:08:43.253
Be a smart, compassionate,
effective leader

00:08:43.286 --> 00:08:47.457
that will redefine the stereotype
of what a female leader is.

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:50.593
I've wasted a lot of time
worrying about how I am perceived.

00:08:51.594 --> 00:08:55.331
If I ask a lot of questions,
will you find me combative?

00:08:56.232 --> 00:08:59.169
If I tell you about
an accomplishment I'm proud of,

00:08:59.202 --> 00:09:00.870
you might think I'm conceited.